<title>JAPAN: Asahi Eito - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Asahi Eito - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to May 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.11		vs	    4.91</p>
<p> Operating	   46    million    vs	  120    million</p>
<p> Current	     56    million    vs	  119    million</p>
<p> Net		   25    million    vs	   57    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.11 yen	  vs	    4.75 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     12 million	  vs	  12 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Asahi Eito Co Ltd is a medium-scale maker of sanitary ceramic ware.</p>
